==Battleground==
*30 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Infernal Pegasus Deonil]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

